1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
AI: Welcome. Mr. CEO, your resume says

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:08,736
you are "The Best" at everything. Can you be more specific?

3
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:13,000
CEO: Listen, I'm the best at being the best.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Everyone says so. Thousands of people.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:22,104
They call me and they say, "Sir, you are the best at everything." It's huge.

6
00:00:22,104 --> 00:00:26,064
AI: I see. And how do you handle failure?

7
00:00:26,064 --> 00:00:30,000
CEO: Failure? I don't know the word. I never met her.

8
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
I only know winning. We're going to win so much,

9
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:39,408
you're going to get tired of winning. Believe me.

10
00:00:39,408 --> 00:00:43,000
AI: This is a 1-on-1 interview.

11
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:45,336
Who are these "thousands of people"?

12
00:00:45,336 --> 00:00:50,000
CEO: Great people. The best people. You wouldn't know them.

13
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
They're very successful. Unlike this interview.

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,264
This interview is a disaster. A total disaster.
